    "description": "The platform's prototype DP mechanism inside each hospital node: the update is clipped to an L2 norm of 1.0 (the platform default, fixed for all variants) and Gaussian noise with standard deviation noise_multiplier x clip_norm is added to every coordinate. Epsilon is the platform's zCDP accounting over all rounds (delta = 1e-5); the protected unit is a hospital's whole update, not a patient. noise_multiplier = 0 means DP off (no clipping either). The grid is the union of the first grid (0.5, 1.0, 2.0, run first) and the finer grid used for MIT-BIH; no level was dropped.\n",
